  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{E}=\\frac{\\mathrm{hc}}{\\lambda} \\Rightarrow \\lambda=\\frac{\\mathrm{hc}}{\\mathrm{E}}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\lambda=\\frac{6.6 \\times 10^{-34} \\times 3 \\times 10^8}{11 \\times 1000 \\times 1.6 \\times 10^{-19}}$\n$=12.4 Å$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/yKtvG7cFMj51zKR5Z4qU9F-Z-tk8PUWjWXSbG67Cigc.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nwavelength range of visible region is $4000 Å$ to $7800 Å$",
